  "text": "Hello Professor Alvarez,\n\nI'd like to book our 30-minute 1:1 for next week. Looking at my calendar, I have these free slots:\n\n- Monday 14:00-14:30\n- Wednesday 15:00-15:30\n- Thursday 14:00-14:30\n\nWould any of those work for you? Happy to fit around your teaching and other commitments if none of them do.\n\nBest,\nDiego",
